---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";

import teamPic from "../assets/teams/intothedeep_26.jpg";
import botPic from "../assets/media/robotics-17.jpg";
---

<Page>
    <div class="segment reverse">
        <img class="full" src={teamPic.src} alt="Team 26145 Robot Photo">
        <div class="segment-content">
            
            <h2>About <span class="keyword">Team 26145</span></h2>
            <p>
                <b>Nighthawks Pathfinder</b> was the first new addition to the Nighthawks Robotics program. Serving as a dedicated learning team, Pathfinder benefits from the guidance and mentorship of North Star members.
            </p>
            <p>
                Since competing in the 2024-25 Into The Deep season, Team 26145 has made a lasting impact on our program. The team focuses on learning engineering, programming, and competition strategies while contributing to the success of the Nighthawks Robotics program.
            </p>

            <h2>Achievements</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Finalist Alliance - 1st Team Selected @ Nii'miis'stii League Tournament</li>
                <li>Inspires Award - 2nd Place @ Nii'miis'stii League Tournament</li>
                <li>Playoff Team @ Alberta Championships</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="segment">
        <img class="full" src={botPic.src} alt="Team 26145 Robot Photo">
        <div class="segment-content">
            <h2>Mentorship & Growth</h2>
            <p>
                Team 26145 benefits from direct mentorship from <a href="/24124">Team 24124 North Star</a> members. Guidance is provided in robot design, programming, and competition strategy to help Pathfinder members develop essential robotics skills.
            </p>
            <p>
                By participating in the Nighthawks Robotics ecosystem, Team 26145 fosters a collaborative learning environment. Members are encouraged to share knowledge and support each other, helping the team grow and succeed in FIRST competitions.
            </p>
            <p>
                Pathfinder also works closely with other learning teams, providing opportunities to engage in mentorship and teamwork, strengthening the overall robotics community at North Trail High School.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Page>
